  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Puzzle_Piece?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fe/Puzzle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20170707200936\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A puzzle piece\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A puzzle piece\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fe/Puzzle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20170707200936\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A puzzle piece</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Puzzle pieces</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">currency</a> used to unlock <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-sanctuary-animals-28587\" title=\"Category:Sanctuary Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sanctuary animals</a>.\n</p><p>They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">reputation</a> level 3.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Obtaining puzzle pieces</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players can obtain puzzle pieces by:\n</p>\n<ul><li>spinning the <a href=\"/wiki/wheel-of-fortune-2745\" title=\"Wheel of Fortune\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wheel of Fortune</a> (random)</li>\n<li>completing special <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> shipments</li>\n<li>finding them in <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery boxes</a>&#160;and <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">treasure chests</a> (random)</li>\n<li>winning horseshoe rewards in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a> (random)</li>\n<li>redeem tokens in the <a href=\"/wiki/valley-shop-31468\" title=\"Valley Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">valley shop</a></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using puzzle pieces</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/66/Book_Stand.png/revision/latest?cb=20170707203229\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"The book stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"The book stand\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/66/Book_Stand.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20170707203229\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The book stand</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f2/Elephant_Puzzles.png/revision/latest?cb=20170619211817\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Puzzles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puzzles\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f2/Elephant_Puzzles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20170619211817\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Puzzles</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Puzzle pieces are collected in the log book from the book stand. When players have completed the puzzle for an animal it becomes available. If players already have the right <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shelter</a> they can place the animal in the <a href=\"/wiki/sanctuary-28458\" title=\"Sanctuary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sanctuary</a>. Otherwise they first have to buy the shelter in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a>.\n</p><p>Each puzzle is composed of 36 pieces.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Currencies</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/chick-voucher-35503\" title=\"Chick Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chick Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"96\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Diamond\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/gift-card-16941\" title=\"Gift Card\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Card\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/puzzle-piece-28177\" title=\"Puzzle Piece\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puzzle Piece\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/token-31466\" title=\"Token\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Token\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-game-features-7440\" title=\"Category:Game Features\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Game Features</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901022846\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 377/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2681/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 625/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.802      1 -total\n 65.97%    8.446      1 Template:Navigation\n 37.35%    4.781      1 Template:CurrenciesMenu\n 27.71%    3.547      1 Template:NavMenu\n 14.95%    1.914      1 Template:Languages\n 13.76%    1.761      7 Template:BigIcon\n  9.22%    1.181      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  7.97%    1.020      2 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:28177-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901022846 and revision id 101824. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
